       | \]
       | 
       | giving \(9-d_{0}\) possibilities for the shift.
       | Both signs \(\pm A_{0}\) are allowed, because if
       | \(A_{0}\mid 1+x^{d}\) then also \(-A_{0}\mid 1+x^{d}\).
       | 
       | Hence the total number of shifty functions is  
       | 
       | \[
       | \sum_{A_{0}} 2\,(9-\deg A_{0}) = 160 .
       | \]
       | 
