       | \end{cases}
       | \]
       | 
       | In polynomial language this is  
       | 
       | \[
       | A(x)B(x)=x^{k}+x^{l}=x^{\min(k,l)}\bigl(1+x^{|l-k|}\bigr).
       | \]
       | 
       | Thus \(A\) must divide a polynomial of the form \(x^{a}(1+x^{d})\)
       | with \(a\ge 0,\;d>0\).
       | 
       | --------------------------------------------------------------------
       | ### 2.  Divisors of \(1+x^{d}\)
       | 
       | Write  
