       | \]
       | 
       | --------------------------------------------------------------------
       | ### 4.  Adding the monomial factor and the sign
       | 
       | For a fixed \(C_S\) of degree \(d\) we may choose any
       | \(a\) with \(0\le a\le 8-d\); then \(A(x)=\pm x^{a}C_S(x)\) has degree
       | \(\le8\) and satisfies the required divisibility.
       | Hence for this \(C_S\) we obtain
