       | \[
       | \bigl(8-d+1\bigr)\times 2 = (9-d)\times 2
       | \]
       | 
       | different functions \(\alpha\).
       | 
       | Summing over the 15 subsets:
       | 
       | \[
       | \begin{aligned}
       | \#\text{shifty } \alpha
       | &= \sum_{S} 2\,(9-\deg C_S)\\
       | &=2\bigl[9+8+7+5+3+3+1+6+4+2+2+3+1+1+2\bigr]\\
       | &=114 .
       | \end{aligned}
       | \]
