       | \]
       | 
       | Thus \(w\) must be coprime to 12.  The possible values are  
       | 
       | \[
       | w\in\{1,5,7,11\}.
       | \]
       | 
       | --------------------------------------------------------------------
       | ### 4.  Counting admissible sequences
       | 
       | For a fixed \(w\) the number of binary 12‑tuples with exactly \(w\) ones is
