       | ### Gram matrix of the three edge vectors  
       | 
       | Let \(\mathbf a,\mathbf b,\mathbf c\) be the three edge vectors; \(|\mathbf a|=|\mathbf b|=|\mathbf c|=s\).
       | For each pair the dot product is either \(s^{2}c\) (if the angle is \(\theta\)) or \(-s^{2}c\) (if the angle is \(180^{\circ}-\theta\)).  
       | Introduce signs \(\varepsilon_{ij}=\pm1\) :
