       | \qquad
       | \mathbf a\!\cdot\!\mathbf c = \frac52\varepsilon_{13},
       | \qquad
       | \mathbf b\!\cdot\!\mathbf c = \frac52\varepsilon_{23},
       | \]
       | 
       | where each \(\varepsilon_{ij}= \pm 1\).
       | 
       | The Gram matrix of the three vectors is  
